    "id": "hoare_partition.note.3",
    "kind": "teaching_note",
    "tutor_visible": true,
    "text": "After swapping, both scans must advance. Return the split when pointers meet or cross; this is not a full sort. Preconditions: Nonempty integer array and 0 <= low <= high < length(a). Return a split index, not necessarily the pivot position."
  },
  {
